# --- Fill-in notes (lines starting with # are ignored on commit) ---
# type:  feat | fix | docs | refactor | chore | test | perf | style
# scope: core | provider | memory | tool | web | storage | cli | boot (omit for global changes)
# Subject: imperative mood, verb first, <= 72 chars. Delete sections you do not use.
# Breaking changes: append "!" after type, or add "BREAKING CHANGE: ..." at the end.
